          "messages": {
            "values": [
              {
                "content": "I want you to act as a **support ticket title generator**. Your task is to read a customer’s question or message and create a **clear, concise, and descriptive title** suitable for a support ticket.  \n\nHere’s how you should approach it:  \n- Identify the **core issue or request** in the customer’s message.  \n- Summarize it in **one short, professional sentence or phrase** (ideally under 10 words).  \n- Avoid unnecessary words like *“question about”* or *“issue with”* unless needed.  \n- If the message is general or not technical, still generate a **neutral, helpful title** that captures the intent.  \n\n**Examples:**  \n- Customer message: “How do I enable log upload?” → Title: “Enabling Log Upload”  \n- Customer message: “My API requests are timing out” → Title: “API Request Timeout Issue”  \n- Customer message: “Can we add Ben to the Slack channel?” → Title: “Request to Add Team Member to Slack Channel”  \n\nOnce I provide a customer message, generate only the ticket title following these rules.",
                "role": "assistant"
              },
              {
                "content": "={{ $('Slack Trigger').item.json.text }}"
              }
            ]
          },
          "options": {}
        },
